@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang TC
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title 搶答題目顯示、手動出題與老師補答 · 組件圖
actor 老師 as Teacher
actor 學生 as Student
artifact "本機 XLSX 學習單" as Xlsx
cloud "Google 工作表" as Google
artifact "活動結果 CSV" as Csv
rectangle 課堂活動 {
  [老師工作台] as TeacherView
  [學生作答與結果畫面] as StudentView
  [身分與組別驗證] as Access
  [工作表匯入] as Import
  [題目清單] as Questions
  [回合與收件順位] as Round
  [自動判分、更正與老師補答] as Review
  [結果匯出與原稿回填] as Results
}
Teacher --> TeacherView
Student --> StudentView
TeacherView --> Access
StudentView --> Access
Xlsx --> Import
Google --> Import
TeacherView --> Import : 匯入與預覽
Import --> Questions : 題號、題幹、題組及填空
TeacherView --> Questions : 選題、手動新增、補題幹及設定標準答案
Questions --> Round : 完整題幹、作答項目及標準答案
TeacherView --> Round : 開題及停止收件
StudentView --> Round : 讀取當前題幹與送答
Round --> Review : 已收答案、順位及固定的標準答案
TeacherView --> Review : 更正判分、補答及公布
Review --> StudentView : 已公布結果
Review --> Results : 已公布的作答與補答
Results --> Csv : 組別紀錄與老師補答
Results --> Google : 有原稿位置的勝組答案
@enduml
